  m_text: "This build is an early playable prototype focused on validating the core
    gameplay loop.\nWhat's working:\nVehicle physics and driving controls\nVehicle
    health system with collision and overrev damage\nFull match flow: pause, victory,
    and defeat states\nGamepad and keyboard support \nWhat's intentionally missing:\nArt
    and audio are currently placeholder. This version's focus is core mechanics and
    systems, not visual polish, those will come in a later pass."
